      "body": "## Question\n\nShould the shop show <script>window.__pwned = true</script> as text, and **not** as bold?\n\n## Context\n\nA line with <img src=x onerror=\"window.__pwned = true\"> and a <b>tag</b>. The page must show every character of it.\n\n## Options\n\n- A: Show it as it is, with the angle brackets.\n- B: Strip the tags. <i>Not chosen.</i>\n\n## Recommendation\n\nA: text is text.\n\n## Docs\n\n- docs/guides/setup.md#installing\n\n## Raised by\n\nSession fixture-session-3.\n\n## Waits on this\n\nThe page test.\n",
